{"tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"10 - 4","variables":{"reserve_2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"millions"},"reserve_2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"millions"}},"sources":{"reserve_2006":"source:q11n3","reserve_2005":"source:q11n4"}},"message":"The reserve for product warranties was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005, so the change is reserve_2006 - reserve_2005 = 10 - 4."}